*
!.gitignore

# Render's free tier has no persistent disk — anything not committed to git
# is gone on the next deploy. So unlike a normal app (where this directory
# would stay gitignored and rely on disk persistence), ALL uploaded media is
# tracked here. After uploading new product/brand images in production,
# `git add storage/app/public` + commit + push so they survive the next deploy.
!**/
!**/*
